	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The audience chamber rings out with Akari's crisp, clear orders to her ministers.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"She enunciates decree after decree with resolute authority.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please make all due haste in the proposed reconstitution of the priesthood.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I will in turn prepare a missive for the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"And yet, her tone is clear and her expression benevolent.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Sitting upon her throne with all the dignity of an Empress, she is a truly fitting symbol of the new Empire.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Ever since her enthronement, Akari has distinguished herself spectacularly with her administration of state affairs, but her work is never done.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"Whether it's conferring with foreign ambassadors, bestowing honors upon distinguished individuals, or presiding over sacred ceremonies and rituals, she hardly even has time to rest.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Sitting up straight in her throne, Akari looks over her assembled ministers.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Speaking of which, I intend to hold a grand banquet in commemoration of all the statesmen and public servants who contributed to the Empire's restoration.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wish to convey my eternal gratitude to all those who devoted themselves in service to the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"The assemblage of ministers in the hall all look up at Akari in shocked disbelief.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Your Majesty, such an event would be entirely unprecedented.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know that perfectly well. You needn't state the obvious, Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Or are you insinuating that it is unbecoming for an Empress to grant her subjects their just reward?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My sincerest apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I bow deeply as she heaps her harsh words upon me.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"All the other ministers look on me with sympathetic gazes.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Since the Empire has reclaimed its peace, I now work as Empress Touka's official secretariat.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"I've spent every waking moment frantically pounding Imperial codes and laws into my head, to the point where\nI'm now just barely able to assist Akari in her duties.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Of course, I also carry the important role of serving as her personal bodyguard.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That is all. You are dismissed.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"The assembly is adjourned, and all of the gathered courtiers file out of the audience chamber.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Leaving behind only me and Akari.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Once she checks to make sure that nobody else is around, Akari lets out a big stretch.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnmmghhh...”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Phew... Remind me, is that all for today?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Now that we're all alone, Akari slips back into her regular, casual tone of voice.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
{"font", size=49},
"“Your dinner with the Republican ambassador has been cancelled on her own account, and all the preparations for the awards ceremony the day after tomorrow have already been completed.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You shouldn't have any issues taking it easy for the rest of the afternoon at least.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Awesome, thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehee, it sure helps having someone around to keep track of my schedule.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Akari leans back in her throne.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"She then holds out her arms towards me.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, come over here.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm too tired to stand. Mind giving me a hand?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“C'mon, now. Your Empress decrees it.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How old are you, again?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, what's the harm? I wanna hold hands.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Akari sulkily puffs out her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Her ministers would be in for a real shock if they ever saw her like this.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Nonetheless, I step atop the dais containing her throne and hold my hands out to her.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come on, put your back into it.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"As soon as I do, though, Akari practically leaps into my arms.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"She throws her arms around me, pressing her soft chest right against mine.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Leaning into my ear, she whispers with a coy smile.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry about earlier, Soujin. For being so tough on you.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm used to it. Don't worry.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Akari tries her best to act the part of an Empress in front of her court.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Naturally, that means she doesn't favor her spouse with any special treatment.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"By demonstrating that I'm on the same level as all her other subjects, she can dispel any allegations that she's showing favoritism to her loved ones.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Have you heard? The rumor mill among the servants is that our relationship has cooled off.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“They don't know how wrong they are.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You said it.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Still, though, do you think I'm being too hard on you?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So long as you keep showing this side of you to me when\nwe're alone, I don't mind it.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehee, really now?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, I'm not gonna hold anything back.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Akari nuzzles her cheek against my chest like a spoiled kitten.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Ever since we became lovers, she hasn't been the least bit shy about showing her affection.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wanna feel your love too, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You got it.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"I slide my arms around Akari's back and pull her close.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"The softness of her body presses even closer to mine, warming up both of our hearts.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's really relaxing when you hold me like this.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wouldn't mind staying like this for the rest of the day...”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Akari murmurs her sweet nothings as I hold her in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nmmh... I love how warm your body is.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Her soft sighs tickle my ears as she presses her body even closer against me.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"The way things are going, I won't be able to hold myself back.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"While I still can, I remove my arms from her back and let her go.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"But Akari continues clinging tightly to my chest, unwilling to be separated from me.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, I...”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Akari whispers falteringly, looking up at me with glistening eyes.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"She doesn't need to say it for me to know what she wants─to be connected far more intimately than a mere embrace.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"A faint blush slowly spreads across her cheeks and exposed shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"That's seriously unfair...",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"How am I ever supposed to resist her when she looks at me like that?",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"And so, I hold her to me closer than ever.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"My impatient hands begin running themselves all across her body.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“S-Soujin, shouldn't we take this back to our room?”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Though her voice is tinged with hesitation, Akari doesn't seem particularly reluctant.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"This hallowed hall is the same place where countless Emperors of the past have conducted important affairs of the state.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"But save for casting a guilty glance over at the throne, Akari says nothing else.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do we have to?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I leave it... up to you.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Akari turns away imperiously.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Given her position as Empress, it's only natural she'd want to preserve some modicum of dignity.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"But we both know that she wants it just as much as I do.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I wanna do it right now.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, can we... Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Well, if you really insist.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Akari lets out a long, exasperated sigh.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"But I don't miss the look of happiness that crosses her face for a split second.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haah... I'm the Empress, and I did it on my own throne.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm never gonna be able to sit here again without remembering it...”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You won't let it interfere with your official duties, though, will you?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if I do, it'll still be all your fault for not taking no for an answer, so you'd better take responsibility.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Unless my memory is failing me, I'm pretty sure Akari was the one to come on to me...",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"But I just shut up and nod.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"As Her Majesty's most loyal servant, it's my job to defend her honor, after all.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"─The next day.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Just like yesterday, another audience is being held in Empress Touka's court.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Akari is sitting on her throne with a dignified expression, lending an attentive ear to one of her ministers.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"At first glance, all seems to be well, but...",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hm?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Suddenly, we make eye contact.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"And when we do, a blush immediately crosses her face.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"She hastily looks down in order to conceal her expression.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I'm sitting in the same spot where Soujin and I...)”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Ahhhhh... Crap, I knew I'd think about it!)”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Akari squirms restlessly in her throne.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Seems like she's recalling the events of yesterday in vivid detail.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"When the courtiers notice her discomfort, they immediately inquire after the state of her health.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"After taking a few moments to collect herself, Akari clears her throat with a delicate cough.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Indeed, as a matter of fact, I have felt slightly feverish since this morning.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I do apologize, but given that I have an awards ceremony to preside over tomorrow, I shall be retiring for the day.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Akari declares as she stands up from her throne.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Her concerned courtiers rush forward to surround her.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I am quite fine to walk on my own.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Akari hastily waves them away, but they are more persistent than she gives them credit for.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Each of them is truly concerned about the wellness of their beloved Empress.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I shall carry Her Majesty to her chambers.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Placing an arm around her shoulders and legs, I sweep her up into my arms.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hweeh?!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“H-Hold it, Soujin! What the heck do you think you're─!”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Akari lets out a gasp and immediately bites her tongue.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Seems like she forgot for a second that she's still in front of her entire court.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your concern is appreciated, but please return to your duties.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"I bow to the dumbfounded ministers and beat a hasty retreat from the audience chamber.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"Still cradled in my arms, Akari heaves a heavy sigh.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ahhhhh... I screwed up big time...”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I talked like normal in front of everyone!”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's so bad about seeming more approachable?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“An Empress has her dignity to consider, you know...”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Akari hangs her head dejectedly.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haah, I don't think I can sit on the throne like normal ever again.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's only been a day, so it's only natural you'd feel awkward.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But maybe you'll get used to it after some more time?”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sh-Should I really be getting used to it?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Alternatively, we could keep doing it there until it doesn't bother you anymore?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You dummy.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Jeez... It feels like as soon as we became lovers, all of the memories we've made have been totally embarrassing.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Puffing out her cheeks, Akari lightly pounds my chest with her fists.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So? You don't actually have a fever, do you?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the plan? Want me to reconvene the court?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
